niche-trends-30d

The approach of looking at what a topic's community engaged with over the last 30 days, across several networks, and scoring it by what people reacted to, was inspired by last30days-skill by Matt Van Horn:

  https://github.com/mvanhorn/last30days-skill

That project is licensed under the MIT License. This repository does not contain its code or its text. The skill here is a separate, prose-only method written from scratch, with a different scope (one niche, text/image/carousel posts only, a scoring scheme relative to the niche, and a guard against invented claims). The notice below is included out of respect for the original work and because the idea carries over.

